Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,In nineteen thirty-two,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.81,0:00:03.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,Australia declared war
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:04.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,on a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:06.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,And lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,Western Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twenty thousand emus marched
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:10.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,into the wheat fields
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:11.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,and treated the crops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:14.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,like an all-you-can-eat buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:14.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the farmers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:16.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,called the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:17.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the army
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:18.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,sent one major,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:19.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,two soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:20.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,two machine guns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,and ten thousand bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.81,0:00:23.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,The emus didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:25.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,follow the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:26.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:26.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,the soldiers got close,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:27.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,the flock scattered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,They set up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,The gun jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:33.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,They chased them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:34.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,with a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:36.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The emus were faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:36.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,The major said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,the birds could face machine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:39.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,guns like tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:40.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,After a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:41.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,the army packed up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.64,0:00:42.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,and went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:44.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:45.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then went home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:47.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,farmers got paid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:49.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,a bounty for every emu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:51.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,and that finally worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the mighty army
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,lost the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,To a bird
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:56.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,that can't even fly.
